    <briefdescription>
<para>Reduction operations. Find the max of scalar a from the PEs in pelist result is also automatically broadcast to all PEs. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><programlisting filename=".F90"><codeline><highlight class="keyword">call<sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="interfacempp__mod_1_1mpp__max" kindref="compound">mpp_max</ref>(<sp/>a,<sp/>pelist<sp/>)</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> <parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>a</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para><computeroutput>real</computeroutput> or <computeroutput>integer</computeroutput>, of 4-byte of 8-byte kind. </para></parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>pelist</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>If <computeroutput>pelist</computeroutput> is omitted, the context is assumed to be the current pelist. This call implies synchronization across the PEs in <computeroutput>pelist</computeroutput>, or the current pelist if <computeroutput>pelist</computeroutput> is absent. </para></parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>    </detaileddescription>
